{"4668870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Juice Crafter", "steam_appid": 4668870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation game where you sell your special recipe juices in medieval villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with your friend to expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Mode and Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the duties with your friend in co-op mode (for up to 2 players).<br>You can also go solo and manage everything alone. You can invite your friend anytime if you change your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fruits, vegetables, flowers, spices, herbs, sugar, milk, and yogurt to craft your special recipe juices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient has different effects (immunity booster, skin refresher, weight loss helper, hydration booster etc).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with everyone in the villages to learn customer preferences, craft juices to achieve the desired effects, and make them your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send letters to your grandpa about your business status and receive his suggestions and machine designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire new teammates like a seller, citrus worker, dishwashing worker, juicer worker, mixing worker, and shopper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get permission to enter new villages, rent new workplaces, and expand your business throughout the new villages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/68dff1f0e0ff29c4ccc83170f2b6bd0e.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/68dff1f0e0ff29c4ccc83170f2b6bd0e.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/68dff1f0e0ff29c4ccc83170f2b6bd0e.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/52d33a28242e2ff108a1b217fddb3fec.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation game where you sell your special recipe juices in medieval villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with your friend to expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/0188f0be3591c1e28fe0f73283123355.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Mode and Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the duties with your friend in co-op mode (for up to 2 players).<br>You can also go solo and manage everything alone. You can invite your friend anytime if you change your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.webm?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/dabec0a0801d4017a3c50c95cb798f35.mp4?t=1787907910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fruits, vegetables, flowers, spices, herbs, sugar, milk, and yogurt to craft your special recipe juices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient has different effects (immunity booster, skin refresher, weight loss helper, hydration booster etc).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with everyone in the villages to learn customer preferences, craft juices to achieve the desired effects, and make them your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send letters to your grandpa about your business status and receive his suggestions and machine designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire new teammates like a seller, citrus worker, dishwashing worker, juicer worker, mixing worker, and shopper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get permission to enter new villages, rent new workplaces, and expand your business throughout the new villages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668870/extras/68dff1f0e0ff29c4ccc83170f2b6bd0e.poster.avif?t=1787907910\" width=7